GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/699803e1-119d-4ea6-80fb-0938962fc855/production-figures?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Production calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches?status=planned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a batch and build its plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend bake",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-11-26T08:00:00+02:00",
  "source": "manual",
  "items": [
    {
      "recipeId": "699803e1-119d-4ea6-80fb-0938962fc855",
      "loaves": 3,
      "starterId": "797cc670-8bdb-4748-9add-b7c0a31fa8cc",
      "starterReminderMinutes": 60
    }
  ]
}

### Plan a batch without saving it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend bake",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-11-26T08:00:00+02:00",
  "source": "manual",
  "items": [
    {
      "recipeId": "699803e1-119d-4ea6-80fb-0938962fc855",
      "loaves": 3,
      "starterId": "797cc670-8bdb-4748-9add-b7c0a31fa8cc",
      "starterReminderMinutes": 60
    }
  ]
}

