Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload a crumb photo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bake-records/b96889e3-e70b-4e14-a45b-70e3fe132a34/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "multipart/form-data": {
    "file": "<crumb.png, image/png, 29 bytes>"
  }
}

### Crumb photos of a bake record
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bake-records/b96889e3-e70b-4e14-a45b-70e3fe132a34/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The image of a crumb photo
